    Denver Centennial  Golden   N_CO_USA Design_Conditions,  !- Name
    39.74,                   !- Latitude {deg}
    -105.18,                 !- Longitude {deg}
    -7.00,                   !- Time Zone {hr}
    1829.00;                 !- Elevation {m}

  SizingPeriod:DesignDay,
